  printf(\"PPGETPHASE = %u\\n\", (unsigned)PPGETPHASE);\n    printf(\"PPGETFLAGS = %u\\n\", (unsigned)PPGETFLAGS);\n    printf(\"PPSETFLAGS = %u\\n\", (unsigned)PPSETFLAGS);\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\nCompile and run this for both -m64 and -m32 (if possible) and report the values. If -m32 doesn't work, just report the 64-bit values, and I'll compute 32-bit manually for the timeval ones.\n\nAlso print sizeof(struct timeval) for both 64-bit and 32-bit if possible."},"uuid":"13166ee7-f0c0-4aaf-b05f-251d8df16cf1","timestamp":"2026-02-07T05:36:19.890Z"}
